# Which iPhone scripts/run_device.sh installs to (optional). Copy this file to Config/Device.local (gitignored), replace
# the identifier below with your iPhone's and uncomment the line. DEVICE_ID=<identifier> in the environment still wins.
# Identifiers: the Identifier column of `xcrun devicectl list devices`.
#
# Without a DEVICE_ID line (no file, or this file as it stands) scripts/run_device.sh uses the one reachable paired
# iPhone and stops if more than one is reachable. scripts/device_smoke.sh, device_llm_smoke.sh and device_benchmark.sh
# write data to the phone and never guess: they refuse unless DEVICE_ID or a DEVICE_ID line in this file names it.
# DEVICE_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
